note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note tasks.om: the tasks of the Omega coding benchmark (bench.om reads this file; it is also Omega
note source, so every reference is compiled). One behaviour per task: `bench check` fails when two
note tasks of a shape agree on every shared input. Frozen: a change here changes expect.txt, and a
note score is only comparable with scores from the same two files.
note The shared inputs stay below 2^41 so that sums and the products asked for do not wrap except
note where a task multiplies large values, which wraps the same way in every implementation.

